gawk — GNU awk interpreter

This r10 candidate rebuilds the reviewed Buildroot 2025.02.1 recipe with the
baseline optional MPFR and libsigsegv features disabled. Its private gawk and
awk executables are exposed with /usr/bin frontends only. The baseline GNU
readline capability is a separately audited, exact runtime dependency:
`libreadline`, which in turn depends on `libncursesw`.
